<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="453176141"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1176157429"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="We are"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ONE OK ROCK"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Ambitions [日本盤]"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:46.720"><div begin="00:13.850" end="03:47.499"><p begin="00:13.850" end="00:22.170" itunes:key="L39653">We are, we are, we are, we are</p><p begin="00:26.020" end="00:29.160" itunes:key="L39654">They think that we're no one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们以为我们不过是无名小卒</span></p><p begin="00:29.170" end="00:32.400" itunes:key="L39655">We're nothing, not sorry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一无是处 无需向我们致歉</span></p><p begin="00:32.410" end="00:33.990" itunes:key="L39656">They push us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们逼迫着我们</span></p><p begin="00:34.000" end="00:37.250" itunes:key="L39657">It's too late, it's too late<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为时已晚 已然太迟</span></p><p begin="00:37.260" end="00:49.459" itunes:key="L39658">Not going back, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不退回从前</span></p><p begin="00:51.980" end="00:54.990" itunes:key="L39659">They think we are made up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们以为我们</span></p><p begin="00:55.200" end="00:58.350" itunes:key="L39660">Of all of our failures<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过是扶不起的阿斗</span></p><p begin="00:58.460" end="01:01.630" itunes:key="L39661">They think we are foolish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们以为我们愚蠢不堪</span></p><p begin="01:01.640" end="01:07.056" itunes:key="L39662">And that's how the story goes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这会是故事的结局</span></p><p begin="01:07.066" end="01:09.440" itunes:key="L39663">They stand for nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们的意见没有任何意义</span></p><p begin="01:10.050" end="01:11.840" itunes:key="L39664">Lifeless and cold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们死气沉沉 冷酷无情</span></p><p begin="01:11.850" end="01:13.280" itunes:key="L39665">Anything they say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们所说的话</span></p><p begin="01:13.290" end="01:18.812" itunes:key="L39666">Will never break our hearts of gold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎会让你我金子般心轻易碎裂？</span></p><p begin="01:19.350" end="01:22.610" itunes:key="L39667">When you're standing on the edge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你站在绝望的悬崖边</span></p><p begin="01:22.620" end="01:25.870" itunes:key="L39668">So young and hopeless<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青春不羁 却又无可救药</span></p><p begin="01:25.880" end="01:28.620" itunes:key="L39669">Got demons in your head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恶魔在你心底蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="01:28.630" end="01:32.320" itunes:key="L39670">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就是 我们正是</span></p><p begin="01:32.330" end="01:35.540" itunes:key="L39671">No ground beneath your feet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是高飞于天际</span></p><p begin="01:35.550" end="01:38.360" itunes:key="L39672">Now here to hold you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为拥抱你</span></p><p begin="01:38.370" end="01:42.270" itunes:key="L39673">'Cause we are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们就是 我们正是</span></p><p begin="01:42.280" end="01:46.590" itunes:key="L39674">The colors in the dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑暗中的一抹色彩</span></p><p begin="01:47.100" end="01:50.280" itunes:key="L39675">Now covered in madness<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心此刻被疯狂麻痹</span></p><p begin="01:50.290" end="01:53.520" itunes:key="L39676">But they just can't hurt us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而他们无法伤害你我</span></p><p begin="01:53.530" end="01:56.720" itunes:key="L39677">They tell us we're nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说我们一无是处</span></p><p begin="01:56.730" end="02:02.080" itunes:key="L39678">Keep walking and let it go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转身离去吧 不要理会</span></p><p begin="02:02.090" end="02:05.180" itunes:key="L39679">They are the weakest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们弱爆了</span></p><p begin="02:05.190" end="02:06.890" itunes:key="L39680">And don't even know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们甚至不明白</span></p><p begin="02:06.900" end="02:08.410" itunes:key="L39681">Anything they say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们所说的话的真正含义</span></p><p begin="02:08.420" end="02:13.742" itunes:key="L39682">Will never break our hearts of gold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怎会让你我金子般心轻易碎裂？</span></p><p begin="02:14.560" end="02:17.730" itunes:key="L39683">When you're standing on the edge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你站在绝望的悬崖边</span></p><p begin="02:17.740" end="02:20.560" itunes:key="L39684">So young and hopeless<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青春不羁 却又无可救药</span></p><p begin="02:21.060" end="02:23.820" itunes:key="L39685">Got demons in your head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恶魔在你心底蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="02:23.830" end="02:27.550" itunes:key="L39686">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就是 我们正是</span></p><p begin="02:27.560" end="02:30.850" itunes:key="L39687">No ground beneath your feet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是高飞于天际</span></p><p begin="02:30.860" end="02:33.580" itunes:key="L39688">Not here to hold you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为拥抱你</span></p><p begin="02:33.590" end="02:37.570" itunes:key="L39689">'Cause we are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们就是 我们正是</span></p><p begin="02:37.580" end="02:39.960" itunes:key="L39690">The colors in the dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑暗中的一抹色彩</span></p><p begin="02:39.560" end="02:42.570" itunes:key="L39691">Never tell yourself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你从未告诫过自己</span></p><p begin="02:42.580" end="02:45.760" itunes:key="L39692">You should be someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不该做自己</span></p><p begin="02:45.770" end="02:48.720" itunes:key="L39693">Stand up tall and say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢站起来大声说吧</span></p><p begin="02:48.730" end="02:52.110" itunes:key="L39694">I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝无畏惧 我绝不害怕</span></p><p begin="02:52.120" end="02:55.350" itunes:key="L39695">So never tell yourself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未告诫过自己</span></p><p begin="02:55.460" end="02:58.640" itunes:key="L39696">You should be someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不该做自己</span></p><p begin="02:58.650" end="03:01.880" itunes:key="L39697">Stand up tall and say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢站起来大声说吧</span></p><p begin="03:01.890" end="03:07.282" itunes:key="L39698">I'm not afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不害怕</span></p><p begin="03:21.050" end="03:24.190" itunes:key="L39699">When you're standing on the edge<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你站在绝望的悬崖边</span></p><p begin="03:24.200" end="03:27.320" itunes:key="L39700">So young and hopeless<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青春不羁 却又无可救药</span></p><p begin="03:27.630" end="03:30.280" itunes:key="L39701">Got demons in your head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恶魔在你心底蠢蠢欲动</span></p><p begin="03:30.290" end="03:34.130" itunes:key="L39702">We are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就是 我们正是</span></p><p begin="03:34.140" end="03:36.980" itunes:key="L39703">No ground beneath your feet<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是高飞于天际</span></p><p begin="03:37.190" end="03:40.050" itunes:key="L39704">Not here to hold you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为拥抱你</span></p><p begin="03:40.060" end="03:43.730" itunes:key="L39705">'Cause we are, we are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们就是 我们正是</span></p><p begin="03:44.040" end="03:47.499" itunes:key="L39706">The colors in the dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑暗中的一抹色彩</span></p></div></body></tt>